cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below, together with the tools it builds on (MFEprimer-3.0 and the others listed in README.md)."
title: "TaqMan Primer/Probe Validator (Nipah edition)"
type: software
abstract: >-
  Measures how well TaqMan primer/probe sets detect the known genomes of a virus. Mismatches are recounted on the genome bases
  (mfeprimer plus an independent genome scan); a genome is validated when both primers have at most one mismatch with an intact
  3' end and the probe matches exactly inside the amplicon. Coverage is reported per lineage/clade and per host scope (human by
  default), with an interactive dashboard, standard-material checks and panel (cross-binding) analysis.
  This copy is the Nipah edition (branch `nipah`).
